# A tab inside the value once split the record, so the string that was
# validated was not the string that was compared. Tabs become spaces before
# anything reads them, and this refuses like any other malformed value.
run available
exit 3
file tasks/M2-01.md
	---
	id: M2-01
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: true	yes
	---
stderr
	tasks.sh: tasks/M2-01.md: exclusive must be yes or no, found: true yes
